timed out. Before trying again, I checked the incident list and found it had been created, so there's no duplicate and the on-call engineer was paged once. It describes what failed, the rollback (including the partial failure and retry) and the current state.\n\nThere are two follow-ups, both recorded in the incident: find out why v2.3.1 broke, and why the orchestrator stopped the first rollback partway.", "type": "text"}]}]}